  "translation": "Gidɛɔn (Gedeɔn) nana, a y'a fɔ ko: mɔgɔ dɔ tun bɛ fin dɔ kunbɛn a kɛnɛni ma, a ko: ninba, ne ye fin yɛlɛ — ani ninba, buru fitini dɔ min kɛra ji ye, a bɛ yɛlɛmɛ-yɛlɛmɛ don ka taa Midiyan (Madian) dunansɔ kɔnɔ; a nana se kɛnɛ dɔ ma, a y'a wuli, kɛnɛ in kunbala, a y'i yɛlɛmɛ ka a lamini a kun na, kɛnɛ in kununna.",
